Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; Rimlock - reverses brave-harden.reg
;
; Right-click -> Merge, approve UAC, then fully restart Brave.
;
; The minus sign before a value name deletes that value. The minus before the
; URLBlocklist key path deletes that whole key. Only the settings the hardening
; file added are touched; nothing else under the Brave policy key is removed.

[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SOFTWARE\Policies\BraveSoftware\Brave]
"IncognitoModeAvailability"=-
"BrowserGuestModeEnabled"=-
"BrowserAddPersonEnabled"=-
"DeveloperToolsAvailability"=-

[-HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SOFTWARE\Policies\BraveSoftware\Brave\URLBlocklist]
